For Indian Nationals 

A student seeking an admission to Ph.D. Programme of the University is required to have minimum educational qualification as mentioned hereunder;

A 1-year / 2-semester master's degree programme after a 4-year / 8-semester bachelor’s degree programme or a 2-year / 4-semester master’s degree programme after a 3-year bachelor’s degree programme or qualifications declared equivalent to the master’s degree by the corresponding statutory regulatory body, with at least 55% marks
